WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.200
Every three decibels up halves the safe time.

2
00:00:04.026 --> 00:00:06.701
At eighty five decibels, eight hours.

3
00:00:07.302 --> 00:00:10.202
Three more decibels, and it is half as long.

4
00:00:13.021 --> 00:00:15.196
Three more, and it halves again.
